# Vouch trust list — https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch
#
# One handle per line, alphabetically sorted, no leading "@".
# Optional platform prefix (e.g. github:handle). Prefix "-" to denounce,
# with an optional reason after a space: "-github:baduser reason".
#
# Maintainers manage this file by commenting "vouch @user" / "denounce @user"
# on any issue (see .github/workflows/vouch-manage-by-issue.yml).
github:kaeawc
